---
code: predict-out-of-dialect
when-fires: a check function body uses a construct outside the check dialect (a strict subset of sh). oracle/predict.rs lift_failure.
why: out-of-dialect input is a lift failure. PASSTHROUGH — the check parser's description rides `detail`.
